{
  "name": "One vertical video to YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok with Preflight",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One vertical video → Shorts, Reels and TikTok\n\nDrop a vertical video into the form. Preflight checks it against each network's video rules (length, size, frame rate, aspect ratio, caption length) **before** uploading anywhere, then queues it for the next free slot on each channel.\n\n- YouTube: published as a Short with the title from the form.\n- Instagram: as a Reel.\n- TikTok: sent to the creator's **inbox** to finish in the app (privacy Only me). Change the TikTok options when you are ready to post directly.\n\nStarting from a long YouTube video? Cut the vertical clip first; downloading videos from YouTube is against its terms. A Google Drive or Dropbox trigger works in place of the form.\n\nThe form is protected with **Basic Auth**: create a login for it in **Upload form**, otherwise anyone with the form link could queue videos to your channels.\n\nPick your Preflight credential and the three channels in the Preflight nodes.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "c6029f20-5aef-51e6-ba4c-5c4ba6812ee8",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New short video",
        "formDescription": "Checked by Preflight, then queued to YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Video",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".mp4, .mov",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Caption",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "YouTube title",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "basicAuth",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "36f7614f-36fc-55ed-988b-da55de85f6bd",
      "name": "Upload form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "053e174e-0def-591c-9dc3-175981932e34",
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Upload form login"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "upload",
        "source": "binary",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Video",
        "kind": "video",
        "waitUntilReady": true,
        "options": {
          "waitTimeout": 900
        }
      },
      "id": "702b7cc8-857e-5c56-b3df-727f13a61460",
      "name": "Upload video to Preflight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "validate",
        "channels": [],
        "content": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json.Caption }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "mediaIds": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "networkOptions": {
          "youtubeTitle": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json['YouTube title'] }}",
          "youtubeShort": true,
          "youtubePrivacy": "public",
          "instagramPlacement": "reel",
          "tiktokPrivacy": "SELF_ONLY",
          "tiktokAsDraft": true
        }
      },
      "id": "a795335f-9085-5ca5-aff0-764c79730b59",
      "name": "Check video rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "58aa6f09-49ae-55c8-9b9a-41b196c3cb78",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0915a4fe-6bc5-50cc-ac6f-18456d138cf8",
      "name": "Passes every network?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "create",
        "channels": [],
        "content": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json.Caption }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "mediaIds": "={{ $('Upload video to Preflight').item.json.id }}"
        },
        "networkOptions": {
          "youtubeTitle": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json['YouTube title'] }}",
